# Repo-root .dockerignore
# Currently only apps/sim-capacity/Dockerfile builds from this context.
# Allowlist approach: exclude everything, then explicitly re-include what the
# Dockerfile needs. Keeps ACR build context small (seconds vs minutes).

*

# sim-capacity image build
!apps/sim-capacity/Dockerfile
!apps/sim-capacity/pyproject.toml
!apps/sim-capacity/src/
apps/sim-capacity/src/**/__pycache__
apps/sim-capacity/src/**/*.pyc
apps/sim-capacity/src/**/*.egg-info

# Review CSVs consumed by calibration modules at runtime
!docs/reviews/2026-06-29-ama-capacity-metadata-review/*.csv
